 to express positive statements. </span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use the negative modals must not, have to, should not, and never, to express negative statements.</span><br> <span class=\"bullet\">Language you can use when you are making an argument.</span><br>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Now decide your topic and start typing.</span><br>\n <span class=\"bullet\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.</span><br><br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Persuasive Writing Aspects\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Contrast (another idea)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"However, On the other hand, Although ....., Unfortunately,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ordering\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First of all, Then, Next, Finally,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Summarizing, Concluding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To sum up, In conclusion, In summary, All things considered,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adding more\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is more, In addition to ..., the ... Further, Not only will ..., but ... will also \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 3"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}]}}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "When writing a p