 spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le16ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blanket "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a covering made of cloth that is used especially on a bed to keep you warm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a blanket to keep warm."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to write about food or drink."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "harmful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing damage or harm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Pollution is harmful to the environment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pass"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go by"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They won't let a single day pass without a cup of tea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "material"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a substance which something is made of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My pillow is made of soft material."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "authentic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "made in the traditional or original way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love authentic Chinese food!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to claim"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to say something is true"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some people claim that tea is good or you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the home of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "where something started"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: China is the home of tea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to convince"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cause someone to believe that something is true"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You use persuasive language to convince someone."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Persuasive Language"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use persuasive language to convince the reader to agree with you about an issue. You use facts to give your opinion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Words like fabulous, best, amazing and special can persuade someone to believe something.</br></br>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">Chinese tea is the best tea in the world!</span></br> </br>Advertisements often use persuasive writing. They use words like amazing, brilliant or free to persuade customers.</br>  People also use persuasive writing to convince you that they are right and/or that someone else is wrong."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use persuasive writing,  Think about your audience. </br><li>Who are you selling to or trying to persuade.</br><li> Choose words that your audience understands. </br><li>List your key points. Think about how to organize your writing. How many paragraphs?</br></br>Language you can use when you are making an argument."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Persuasive Writing Aspects\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Contrast (another idea)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Coffee is good. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">However</span>, excess of coffee can hurt you.<br>      Sugar gives you energy. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Oh the other hand</span>, it has many calories. <br>     <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Although</span> chocolate is delicious, a large amount can give you a headache and stomach ache. <br>      Wine is tasty. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Unfortunately</span>, it has a lot of calories.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ordering\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can eat healthily. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">First of all</span>, eat at regular hours. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Then</span>, try to avoid saturated fat. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Next</span>, control the amount of food you eat. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Finally</span>, never forget to have your daily meals.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Summarizing, Concluding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">To sum up</span>, drinking tea is a very healthy habit.  <br>    <span class=\\\"strong\\\">In summary</span>, breakfast is the most important daily meal.<br>      <span class=\\\"strong\\\">All things considered</span>, don't eat too much meat, principally red meat.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adding more\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tea is a very healthy drink. <span class=\\\"strong\\\">What's more</span>, black tea is the healthiest type. <br>    <span class=\\\"strong\\\">In addition to</span> healthy, daily exercise will make you fit.<br>      Sleeping well <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will not (won't) only</span> help your body relax, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">but</span> it will <span class=\\\"strong\\\">also</span> make your memory better.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research food and drink that help with health problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose three items and write a sentence for each."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner or family member."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Food or Drink\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What Does It Help?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp; <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research food and drink."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the information with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write three sentences about food and health."}]}], "type": "sena"}